+
+The hidden About body is prepared as build-owned inert data and constructs its native DOM only when opened (`renderInformationPages.tsx` → `staticCatalog.js` → `informationBridge.ts`). Public About HTML remains directly prerendered/readable without JavaScript. This reduces startup parsing without introducing another page or parsing stored/user HTML. The materialized page matches its prior markup exactly; legacy template catalogs retain their existing fast path.
